msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0752.rst:518
msgid ""
"Microsoft: `azure- <https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-python/tree/main/"
"sdk>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0752.rst:520
msgid "Examples of typosquatting attacks targeting Python users:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0752.rst:522
msgid ""
"``django-`` namespace was squatted, among other packages, leading to a "
"`postmortem <https://mail.python.org/pipermail/security-announce/2017-"
"September/000000.html>`__ by PyPI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0752.rst:525
msgid ""
"``cupy-`` namespace was `squatted <https://github.com/cupy/cupy/"
"issues/4787>`__ by a malicious actor thousands of times."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0752.rst:528
msgid ""
"``scikit-`` namespace was `squatted <https://blog.phylum.io/a-pypi-"
"typosquatting-campaign-post-mortem/>`__, among other packages. Notice how "
"packages with a known prefix are much more prone to successful attacks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0752.rst:532
msgid ""
"``typing-`` namespace was `squatted <https://zero.checkmarx.com/malicious-"
"pypi-user-strikes-again-with-typosquatting-starjacking-and-unpacks-tailor-"
"made-malware-b12669cefaa5>`__ and this would be useful to prevent as a "
"`hidden grant <hidden-grants_>`__."
msgstr ""

